 "script": "GTA 6 just got eight Game Awards nominations, before a single review. That includes Game of the Year, Best Narrative, and Best Game Direction. It's the most nominated game of the show. It only qualifies because the cutoff is November 20, and it launches the 19th. Winners are 90 percent media jury votes and 10 percent fan votes, with the show on December 10. Fan voting opened even though nobody could play it yet. Some fans are calling it rigged. Fair, or too early? Comment your pick.",
